<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - EXPORT PRICE INDEX UP 0.6 PCT IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - EXPORT PRICE INDEX UP 0.6 PCT IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's export price index showed a rise of 0.6 percent month-on-month in June compared to a rise of 0.5 percent the month before, the statistics office said on Monday.</p>
<p>In the second quarter, the index rose by 1.8 percent, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>Compared to June 1996, the rise was 9.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
